WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.440
All of us are at least 20 years old!

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.030
Hmm...

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.950
Have I put on a little weight?

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.740
This bra is really starting to get tight...

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:19.620
Let's just gather up all that fat and...

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.250
I wonder if the laundry is done yet.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.420
Oh my goodness, I'm so sorry!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.010
That definitely was not a sight meant for young eyes...

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.720
You almost wouldn't believe it.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.600
So I opened the door and Kae-san was there,
which was surprising enough.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:12.610
But then you know, they were all like this,
and it just blew my mind...

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.730
Huh?

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:18.070
It's not often you get to see that much
of another woman, huh?

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.570
Hmm...

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:21.660
<i>Makoto, check this out!</i>

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.740
<i>I'm a cavewoman!</i>

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:24.990
<i>A renaissance painting!</i>

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:26.750
<i>Now I'm Indian!</i>

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.500
Gah! She's laughing at me!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.250
Tokyoites must have no qualms
about seeing other women naked!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.670
And her lingerie was so sexy!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:40.260
My underwear still has Ribbon Kitten on it like some little kid,

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.640
I felt so embarrassed...

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.310
Well, I'm still a fan of Ribbon Kitten myself.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.140
Look!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.640
Meowwww?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.810
Oh, my! It really is cute right?!

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.150
<i>Why does she seem relieved all of a sudden?</i>

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.650
Oh.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:58.820
Kae-san!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.530
Wow, those have to be the most grown-up pajamas ever!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.370
It's a gown actually.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.160
A gown!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.370
<i>That's so cool! She's like the wife of some billionaire!</i>

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:08.910
<i>The epitome of a metropolitan woman!</i>

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.670
<i>Michiru-chan has such wonderful skin...</i>

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:16.000
<i>Compared to her, my complexion
gives my age right away...</i>

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.300
<i>I wish I could be more like her...</i>

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.380
<i>But I feel I lack a certain something.</i>

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.510
Well you two...

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.930
I'm going to have some red wine. Do you want some?

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.390
Red wine!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.440
<i>That's it!</i>

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.980
Yes please, yes please!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.480
Well someone sure is excited.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.480
Do you like red wine?

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.110
I've never even tried it before.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.020
Really now...?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.450
<i>I wonder how it tastes.</i>

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.530
<i>Is it like an alcoholic version of grape juice or something?</i>

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.950
Okay, here you are, then.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.450
Well, here goes.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.790
<i>This is nothing like I expected!
It's so tart! Not even a bit sweet!</i>

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.590
<i>It feels like it's scratching
its way through my mouth and throat!</i>

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.000
What do you think?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.800
My, my, my... i-it's marvelous, yes.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.930
I can practically see the vineyards of Bordeaux
sprawling out before me indeed.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.350
<i>She definitely hated it...</i>

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.600
Care for any Makoto?

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:12.020
To be honest, I'm not big on red wine.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:16.110
It tastes so sharp and sour,
I can hardly imagine drinking it.

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.650
White wine I could at least get down I guess.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.110
<i>So Makoto isn't fond of it either, huh...?</i>

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.030
Fair enough.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.820
I had a hard time drinking it at first, myself.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.120
Once you get used to it though, it's wonderful.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.580
If... we're being honest...

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.160
I don't think it's really my thing either.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.020
Well, I have something just for you two, then.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.210
Mix it up with this and you'll have yourself
a wonderful cocktail!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.630
Ginger ale?

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:42.840
Just take one part of your favorite red wine
and mix it with one part ginger ale.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.010
And viola, you have yourself a "Kitty" wine cocktail!

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.140
Try it with some cheese and almonds.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.100
It's so bubbly!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.390
"Kitty," huh...? What a cute name for a cocktail.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:56.350
It's not just the name that's cute either.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.900
Go ahead and try it and see how "cute" it tastes too!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.230
Cheers!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.820
The sharpness is gone!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:11.160
The bubbles take the bite right out of the wine.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.750
The ginger ale even gives it a little sweet kick.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.920
It's hard to even believe
this is the same wine as a second ago!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.420
And I can't stop eating these almonds and cheese either.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.920
Whoa, now! Save some for me!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.550
So, I work as a wedding planner, right?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.430
Well, that there is one of the cocktails
on the menu at our venue.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:32.140
It looks just as fancy as normal wine,

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.940
but it's so much easier to drink, that we often recommend it.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.100
At weddings, huh...?

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.440
Seems like all that's still some far away world.
Must be beautiful though.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:44.650
I've never even thought of getting married.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.490
Or about kids... I wonder if I'll ever have any...

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.450
It's hard to imagine, huh?

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.580
Even if I started seeing someone,

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.460
I'd want to get to know them for two or three years first.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.630
And then I'd probably want
to try living together for at least a year or so...

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:07.840
I hear that it's hard to know when or how to move on
to marriage once you already live together, though.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:12.470
And if that's true, you probably want to start
thinking about marriage now before it's too late!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.930
It's definitely better to start
giving it a thought sooner than later.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.640
Think about how many years you have left to live,

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.060
when and how you might spend time with who,

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.980
and then plan out how to use your time.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:26.280
Though that's not to say things
will always go according to plan...

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.030
Let's just take it easy now!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.990
You're still so young!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.740
Here. I brought more snacks!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.620
Just take a cracker and throw whatever you want on it!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.620
Well then, I think I'll go for some cream cheese and ham!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.500
Cheese then. Every single kind all at once!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.420
This is kinda like a party huh?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.670
Glad we can have so much fun with such cheap wine.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:51.390
It's not often we get the chance to drink fancier wine.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:55.060
That sort of stuff is only
for special anniversaries and the like.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.310
And when you have none to celebrate...

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.230
Let's make one up, then!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.270
If we all split the bill it won't be that bad!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:10.910
When you spend each and every day
dealing with newly engaged couples...

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.830
you start to feel like none of us
are really meant to live alone...

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.290
Kae-san, maybe you should hold back a bit?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:25.040
But I suppose I live here
with all of you so I'm not exactly alone.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.630
Kae-san...

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:31.800
But don't you dare go moving out of here before me!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.970
Makoto-san would never do that, right?

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.220
N-no, probably not!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:46.610
I'm headed off to bed then. You two enjoy yourselves.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.230
Are you sure you're okay?

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.400
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.070
Let's clean up and call it a night, then.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.070
Huh?

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.870
Is that phone...?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.330
It must be Kae's.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.330
Kae-san! You forgot this!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.080
Come on in, the door's open.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.750
Sorry to intrude.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.590
Don't be shy.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.340
I-I... uh, think you forgot this.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.090
Oh. Thanks.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:18.600
Whew. Nothing like a nice night of drinks!

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.600
Make sure you drink plenty of water
so it doesn't come back to bite you in the morning.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:23.730
Now then I'll-

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:25.100
Wha-?!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.940
Come on Michiru-chan, just stay a bit longer.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:29.610
What?

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.030
It's so lonely in here!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.110
Come on, cuddle up with me, cuddle, cuddle!

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.370
Wait, what?! I don't- Ah!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:39.450
So nice and warm!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.450
<i>Wh-what on earth is going on here...?</i>

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.870
I'm gonna hug you like a stuffed animal all night!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.790
I-I have my own room to sleep in...

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.290
What a meanie!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.550
How could you turn me down like that?

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:54.380
Don't think an almost thirty-year-old like me
has got it in her anymore?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.390
Well... what do you say to this?!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:03.890
Here's what a real woman's body is like!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:04.520
O-oh my...!

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.400
Michiru-chan!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:11.900
K..Kae-san, you acted so embarrassed earlier yet now...

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.860
Oh Michiru-chan, you're so adorable... I...

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.910
I could just eat you up...

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.950
I bet I'd be really oily and not the tiniest bit tasty at all!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.000
You'd be much better off
eating something tastier, I'd say!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:24.660
So just...!

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.540
Michiru-chan!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:36.930
Good morning.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.850
Good morning, Michiru-chan.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:43.180
Uh, Kae-san... about...

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:50.190
<i>Gah... I can't even look her straight in the face.</i>

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.320
Well, you sure seem down this morning.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.610
Don't tell me you drank too much last night?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:10:00.200
Umm, Kae-san, do you even remember last night?

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.790
Hmm? What about it?

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:07.210
Well I went up to your room, and then...

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.210
"And then"...?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.050
Mornin'!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.510
Good morning.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.010
Sorry, Michiru-chan!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:22.010
It just... I felt so warm, that I couldn't let go...

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.720
<i>We'd all best watch how much we drink.</i>

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:00.650
Red wine has a surprisingly high alcohol content of 14%.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.610
That's about 3 times as much as beer.

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:08.240
When drinking a Kitty though, you mix it half
with ginger ale to bring it down to about 7% proof.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:13.080
But since it's so much easier to drink, you really
gotta make sure you don't drink too much or else!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.630
Here's to another night!
